### Real suspend hangs SM8550; systemd-suspend.service drop-in handles fake-suspend.
### logind must allow suspend so systemctl suspend flows through to the drop-in.

### Ignore power button presses — input_sense owns the button.
cat <<EOF >~/.config/logind.conf.d/login.conf
[Login]
HandlePowerKey=ignore
HandleSuspendKey=ignore
EOF
